Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:05.19,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,So you were helping her \Nfind her lost brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, she hired me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,She said they were separated \Nwhen they were very young.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:14.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And you got them happily reunited?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:15.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:19.37,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Wait. But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:21.96,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,What was with the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It was a memento from their parents,\Nwho died when they were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:30.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The brother got their mother's ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:34.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The sister got their father's tie pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.38,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They kept them as proof \Nthat they were siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:40.62,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Dammit. That's wholesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.92,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,May I ask why you two were tailing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:48.60,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Oh, you saw us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:51.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I told you he would!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:54.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry we interrupted your work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:55.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:57.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I assumed you were shadowing me to see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:01:01.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,if I was a worthy partner \Nfor Shizuka-san, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.67,0:01:05.66,Flashback - Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Wait, is he watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:10.33,Flashback - Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I have to get this job done right \Nso he sees I'm a hard worker!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:15.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was pretty nervous but... \Ndid I get it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:16.96,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.73,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, s-sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.01,0:01:25.01,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Point is, if you ever do \Nanything to hurt my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:29.60,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,I'll bash you with my bat, so be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:34.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That bat is plastic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:38.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You have a bat? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.49,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're not staying with me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:49.20,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,I'll stay at a net cafe tonight\Nand make my way home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:53.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you both like to stay at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:55.65,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:59.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, I have space for three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:01.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure, Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:05.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Futa-san, you don't have \Nto accommodate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:10.12,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Nah, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ah. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:15.78,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Next time, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,By all means!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:23.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, Fu-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.26,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:27.37,Italics,Futa,0,0,0,,{M}If this guy marries my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.87,Italics,Futa,0,0,0,,{M}We'll basically be family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.35,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,You've always been like this!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:32.63,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,But at least let me spot you \Na proper hotel...{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.25,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san! You don't have to \Nplay the SD with Fu-kun!{gb}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.18,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,What? I didn't mean to...{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.16,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,You're SDing all over the place!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:32.63,Italics,Futa,0,0,0,,{M}I don't know much about him \Nbesides the detective stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:36.94,Italics,Futa,0,0,0,,{M}I don't wanna be family with \Na guy whose expressions I can't even read.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:43.48,Italics,Futa,0,0,0,,{M}But that stuff doesn't matter to sis. \NShe acts normal even around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:45.97,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.28,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Tonome-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.89,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,You better look after my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I-I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:17.28,Italics,Message,0,0,0,,Good morning. I made breakfast. You can \Nheat it up in the microwave and eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's from Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:26.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Let's find out what he made me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:33.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,French toast, courtesy of Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:35.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's not too sweet, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:41.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san had to go to work early, \Nbut we have tomorrow off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:43.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:50.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I believe we have... carrots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:51.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Potatoes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:56.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And the roux should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:03:59.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:00.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:04.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:08.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're not mad at me for cooking \Nwhile you were gone, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:14.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be \Ncoming home to your cooking...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:16.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:21.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well, you made breakfast for me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:26.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It matters to me that \Nyou made yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:28.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's like we're really married, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.11,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm blushing so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.63,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}How long is every little thing \Ngoing to tickle me like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:47.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I got an email from my rental agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:51.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,They say my lease is up for renewal soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:52.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do you think, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, we'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:59.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We've been so cautious about selecting \Na property, we haven't gotten it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:05.90,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,AT MOST A 10 MINUTE WALK FROM THE STATION - SAFE AREA\N CLOSE ENOUGH TO WORK - NEAR A CONVENIENCE STORE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:03.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We never found anything \Nthat fit all our wants, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:11.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But I've loved the nights \Nwe've spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:17.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Though my apartment's so small, \Nwe've mostly spent them at yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.50,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you rather put off getting \Na place of our own?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:22.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, I definitely want to \Nget a place of our own!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:26.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But I've gotten so used to this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:32.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,the idea of shifting to a new environment \Nfeels both exciting and sad, all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:38.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you just like to move in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I didn't know that was an option!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:45.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Then you won't have to \Nget used to a new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:51.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Then let's start packing up \Nyour things and move them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:52.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:56.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That was easy, wasn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:58.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It was an unexpected blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.60,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, you're moving in with Tonome?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.10,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's such a big moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:08.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Huge, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:12.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We're going through \Nthe process of moving things now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:13.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,If you need any heavy lifting,\N give me a call!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:17.82,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I can carry your stuff to Tonome's house \Nwithout breaking a sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You mean it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:24.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:27.91,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Easy as pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.36,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,So strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.11,Main - Top,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I can have it done in an hour!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:32.13,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,So fast!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:34.58,Main - Top,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's easier than breathing!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:29.79,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey, Tonome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:30.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:34.62,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,The girls are acting like we're \Nin the Stone Age out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.48,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,but you wanna use our van to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:48.05,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Elf Garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:50.51,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,I'd like some black tea for a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:53.72,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Sure thing! I recommend one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.68,Main,Cat Animal,0,0,0,,By the way, what's up with your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.06,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Haven't seen her in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:03.81,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Why'd it get dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.36,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,She didn't abandon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.77,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,K-Karma-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:14.24,Main,Cat Animal,0,0,0,,You'll be okay! \NShe's coming back, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.77,Main,Cat Animal,0,0,0,,So bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:28.31,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.51,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:46.54,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, I can handle the heavy lifting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:47.81,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.94,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.68,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,But stand back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.00,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Stand back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.20,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,A little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.20,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:03.86,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,There, that'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:09.41,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,My curse shouldn't affect you \Nfrom that distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:21.31,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I've received blessings from all \Nthe white elves in the elf forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:25.20,Main,Light,0,0,0,,One little dark elf curse \Nwon't do squat to hurt me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:28.94,Main,Light,0,0,0,,so shut up and apply that \Nstretch mark cream to my belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.48,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:31.98,Main,Light,0,0,0,,You're still on that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:34.18,Main,Light,0,0,0,,You think the power \Nof white elves can't—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:39.23,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Light? Light?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:44.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Contractions?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.88,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yeah. Started all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So the baby's coming soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:53.08,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,But there's still a little \Nwhile until her due date.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:56.12,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,So I got freaked out \Nand panicked a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:00.59,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:02.40,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Light! Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.88,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:06.14,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:09.74,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Call my father and the hospital now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.48,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,And get my overnight bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:12.86,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:21.08,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:27.34,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Karma. I didn't tell you this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:29.93,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,It's actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:34.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Twins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.28,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:38.92,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,She said she wanted to \Nkeep it secret as a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:42.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Are you not actually happy about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:49.22,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Oh, a cup fell off the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:55.38,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,It's been like this since \NLight went to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:59.22,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous about the babies arriving\N safely, my curses keep leaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:01.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Will the delivery be difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:02.68,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:07.87,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Light's family has been at the hospital, \Npreparing for the birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.84,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I think that should all be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:12.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Her whole family is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:16.92,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,White elves start the birthing \Nprocess by being bathed in blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:18.66,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:22.51,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,If my curses did anything \Nto harm Light or the babies...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:32.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san, when you \Ninvited us out here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:36.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Were you trying \Nto pass your curse on to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:37.64,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Busted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's leave here at once, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:43.08,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:46.53,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm so worried I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:48.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I understand that you're upset,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:53.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but can't you vent your curse \Npower like you did before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:57.48,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,My fear is outpacing what I can vent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.79,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Can't I share the burden with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:02.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I won't allow you \Nto drag Shizuka-san into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:04.72,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,What's wrong with passing \Nmy curses on to people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:06.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know where to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's twins, and it's her first pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:14.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I think we should try \Nto comfort him as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:20.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Can't we stay with him \Njust a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:24.00,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Shizuka-chan's so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:29.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But you'll be in danger if anything \Nelse falls, so remain beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:30.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:31.68,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And Karma-san will maintain \Na respectful distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:41.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What just happened? Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:42.58,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:45.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Where did that washbasin come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:54.73,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I managed to convince \NShizuka-san to go home, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:57.40,Main - Top,Karma,0,0,0,,Snuggle snuggle snuggle snuggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:57.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why are you clinging to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.02,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Interesting question!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You've been like this the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.93,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Wanna go to your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.17,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'll pick us up something \Nat the convenience store!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:10.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're coming to my place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.20,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Don't be a shy guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.52,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hang on, brb!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Seriously, how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:30.65,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san isn't even here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:35.56,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Looks like I've granted you \Nsome of my curse, Tonome-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:39.21,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What?! But I don't feel any different...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:40.92,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Worked faster than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:44.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You just passed your curse on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Take it off, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:50.06,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,That's not happening, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:52.37,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm a cursed dark elf, remember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:54.37,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why are you acting proud of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How long is this supposed to last?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:59.62,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Well, duh! Until my fears go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.62,0:13:02.80,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Which means until the babies are born!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:07.59,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.09,0:13:09.76,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,They say I can talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:11.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Light-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:15.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Your babies will be here soon. \NYou must be excited to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:18.74,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:21.79,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,L-Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.88,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,{M}That's right. I'll meet them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.04,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,{M}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:37.05,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,{M}I've got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:39.45,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,{M}Thinking just makes me more scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.72,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,LIGHT\NLIME VIDEO CALL
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:48.42,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.22,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Karma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:53.16,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,Light! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:55.27,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:57.63,Main,Light,0,0,0,,They've given me all \Nthe blessings I need for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:13:59.87,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Are you coming soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:00.79,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Of co—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.24,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:06.13,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,I really can't be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:11.42,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I can't afford to curse the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:14.32,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\N Karma, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.62,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.82,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Even if you say it's fine, if...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:21.71,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,if I come by and something really happens \Nto you and the babies...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:22.66,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.84,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:32.51,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so useless... \Nand helpless...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.75,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:36.28,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I don't need you to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:38.13,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I just want you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.39,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Karma. Come and be with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.53,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Are you crying too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:53.24,Main,Light,0,0,0,,It's just... It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:59.28,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm also super nervous, and the babies \Nare waiting for you, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:04.74,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Get over yourself and\N come over here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:06.05,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:08.88,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.84,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I know I said I wouldn't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.97,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Kikira-san said he'd be by this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:25.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:32.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I should put these old dishes \Nin the trash pick-up spot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:37.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Stay back! It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:47.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:55.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It just ripped through all \Nthe packing tape at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:58.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I think it's Karma-san's curse in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:02.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He said he'd transferred \Nsome of his curse to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:06.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It means bad things will happen \Neven when he's not in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:11.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It apparently just causes \Nsmall misfortunes, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:16.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If only I'd stuck around longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.91,0:16:20.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't want you \Nto get hit by it, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:23.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I want to protect you, Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:32.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Seriously, why washbasins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:58.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:09.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I came to help, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:10.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:15.21,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If I hadn't asked to stay \Nwith Karma-san in the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:20.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And then you tried to help me move \Nand ended up having a miserable time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Seriously, it's just the curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.65,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You dropped the dishes and got hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:27.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If you hadn't come to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:30.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,the curse's effects might \Nnot have been so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:38.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san, why don't you \Ngo home and take it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,They're my things, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:44.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can work on the packing \Nuntil Kikira-san comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:51.79,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. Don't say something so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:55.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I've been working despite the problems
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:57.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,because I want you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:17:59.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:05.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're not getting rid \Nof me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:07.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't trying to get rid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:14.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't want Karma-san's curse \Nto affect our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:16.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's also fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:20.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:24.46,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The curse won't move \Nfrom you to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:25.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:28.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Then, since I'm not \Naffected by the curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:33.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,if I lie on top of you, \Nthings shouldn't fall on you, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:33.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:35.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If I may!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:38.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Take that, you stupid curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:41.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're helpless in the face of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:49.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Nothing's happening. I think it's worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:51.65,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san, can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:56.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:57.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,N-No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:01.03,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,KARMA-SAN \NLIME VIDEO CALL
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:03.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hello? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:07.41,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Tonome-chan! My babies! My twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:10.04,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:12.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:14.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Your curses didn't hurt anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.38,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,Everyone's doing just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:18.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, that's great to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.67,0:19:23.56,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to be with Light \Nand meet the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:25.04,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,If not for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:30.44,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,the curse probably would have \Ncrushed me before I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:33.60,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,You really are the guy \Nto have around in a pinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:35.78,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd rather not be, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:39.76,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I'm just glad everyone's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:42.32,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,My curse should have \Nlost effect by now, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, that explains that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:48.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It may have been gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:52.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I guess covering you \Ndidn't do much, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:54.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm glad it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:57.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you \Nwere willing to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.49,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:08.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:11.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We had a little trouble, \Nso packing's fallen behind, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.55,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,No problem. I assumed \Nwe'd be helping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.39,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:17.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Madaraito-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.12,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Daichi told us everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.36,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,The more hands the better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:25.49,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're all here! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.36,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Where are the boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:29.59,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'll carry out whatever's ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:33.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They'll get it done, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:48.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you for all your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:48.99,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:49.97,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Looks like we got it all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:11.98,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,They really had everything \Nrunning smoothly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:12.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:15.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's take our time \Ngetting things unpacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:21.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's right... We never got \Nto eat, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:25.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How about we order pizza \Nand have a moving party?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:27.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:33.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Good moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:34.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:45.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Our life together begins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.88,0:21:46.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:48.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:50.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:53.90,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}What could it be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:55.83,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:58.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A ring?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:02.58,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}We've met each other's parents, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:06.08,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Or am I just leaping \Nto conclusions again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:13.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please hold out your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.09,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Left hand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.72,0:22:18.63,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Is it really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:34.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:35.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The key.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:38.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's our place now, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.45,0:22:40.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yours and mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It turned out to be \Na bit of a rehearsal, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.39,0:22:45.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I had an extra key made earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:47.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:51.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:00.17,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:01.73,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:18.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-And...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:18.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:23.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I wanna use our key, \Nso let's go somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:24.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:26.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How about getting some \Ndessert from the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.11,0:23:31.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,An outing and dessert for our big day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:31.98,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.98,0:23:33.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:35.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They have a lot of great \Ndesserts these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:36.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What are you getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A chocolate banana crepe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.81,0:23:40.02,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 12: A BIG MOMENT\N THE END
